  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT IS THE CONNECT THE NATURAL GAS FOR 160,000 UNITS LOCATED IN AREAS OF CAIRO ,GIZA AND ALEXANDRIA. THIS CONNECT ION INCLUDES THE CONSTRUCTION OF A COMPLETE DISTRIBUTION SYSTEM WHICH CAN BE REALIZED GRADUALLY. THIS PHASE III IS DEVIDED INTO FOUR SUB_PHASE THE FIRST AIMS AT CONNECTING NATURAL GAS FOR 40,000 CUSTOMERS.</narrative>
  </description>
